{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1246518-describe-your-character-in-a-few-sentences","id":1246518,"title":"Describe your character in a few sentences","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-08-15T19:47:15-07:00","id":1246518,"title":"Describe your character in a few sentences","content":"Bonus Question: What is the one sentence backstory of your character?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-16T01:28:41-07:00","id":1246571,"title":"","content":"Golden Hero: The darkest night requires the brightest heroes! In his mighy golden warstrider Godspeed Vanguard, the heroic northern Shining One known as Golden Hero, once just a humble slave-smith, has sworn to defeat the Realm that brutally murdered his fianc\u00e9e! He fights for justice, truth, and the New Day!<br /> (Warning: Night Castes may be significantly less heroic than they first appear)<br /> Skills: Crafting, Athletics, stabbing demons, stealth<br /> <br /> Brother Alazar: When the new Abbott of the Black Monastery of Leng decided to open the forbidden vaults of that pre-human structure, Brother Alazar objected, but couldn't stop him. Deep in the bowels of the cthonic corridors, the monks accidentally released the Nephwrack known as He Who Shall Not Be Described. Most of the monks immediately went insane, but Alazar resisted and exalted as a Night Caste. He escaped, and went off to learn kung-fu (from another PC, that's why he joined the group) so he could defeat the Nephwrack and get revenge. He's been investigating/battling the Nephwrack's cult with the other PCs, but the Nephwrack is always one step ahead.<br /> Skills: Occult, Investigation, alchemy, Tiger style.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T08:25:50-07:00","id":1248066,"title":"","content":"Is no-one else going to post? I'm interested to see what people are playing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T09:02:31-07:00","id":1248082,"title":"","content":"I'm game. Give me a tick to get it together! <br /> <br /> Exalted PCs only, or also interesting character ideas that might become seeds in an Exalted scope?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T09:33:02-07:00","id":1248104,"title":"","content":"Monsoon Dancer: A god-queen in formation, this rowdy sailor is a creature of excesses and a paragon of bursting vitality, infatuated with life itself. As she strives to live up to her devotion to her pirate company, she charms, taunts, brawls and murders her way into showing the world their lives are only worth what they make of it, and it is their birthright to make the most of it. Don't touch her subjects.<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FMA245</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1246518-describe-your-character-in-a-few-sentences#post1246518\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bonus Question: What is the one sentence backstory of your character?</div> </div> </div> </div>Family tried to rein her wildness with immaculate training, but the immaculates couldn't stand her either.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T10:57:26-07:00","id":1248135,"title":"","content":"Kit, the Ethereal Carmine Princess of Eventide - Night Caste - She is a hyperactive teenage ninja, like a cross between A-ko (Athletics Supernal) and Senran Kagura. <br /> <br /> She has no idea why she was Chosen, to begin with, and initially plays as a bubbly foil to the <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">dead serious</span> plot expositions of the rest of the Circle. Sometime mid-Chronicle she'll get a plot point and have a <i>Let's Get Dangerous</i> moment. We'll find out that the Ethereal Princesses of Eventide were a divergent sect of Solar assassins (and their Lunar counterparts) who eschewed traditional power structures in favor of operating in the shadows and half-truths of the First Age. Many rogue gods and Chosen fell to their swords and fangs -- the Exaltation of the Ethereal Princesses chooses those who can maintain a fundamental optimism even in the face of corruption and otherworldly horrors. <span style=\"font-size:11px\">(longer than one sentence but there ya go)</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T11:10:12-07:00","id":1248143,"title":"","content":"Alhambra, the Vigilant Tower - Dawn Caste - This giant of a warmaster leads his cavalry from the front. Riding on Jasomir, his dire badger mount, he gallops into battle wielding Tangled Helix, the seven-plaited braided-glass Direlance; and protected by the Thousand Storms Mantle, a heavy artifact armor. His Anima effect is the quaking and cracking of the ground. His armor resembles that of Ozen the Immovable. He is called the Vigilant Tower because his only fear is that his allies be harmed because something gets past him. His defining Principle is &quot;Like deserves like&quot; so the wise lord will be kind and generous in his looming presence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T11:28:20-07:00","id":1248148,"title":"","content":"Kalifiir Sabra, The Stubborn Tiger - Eclipse Caste - Kalifiir is a slightly-built and bookish young man with the characteristic pale skin and bluish hair of some people from the North. Though all Exalted age gracefully, he looks younger than he actually is. Disappointed with his failure to Exalt as Chosen of Air like his close siblings, his family sent him on an expedition into the Bordermarches, in an attempt to provoke a Second Breath in the otherwise bookish scion ... or to remove a disappointment from the family line. Kalifiir did Exalt, but not into the Air Caste: the expedition was captured by a Raksha raiding party, and while in their clutches, Kalifiir was Chosen to become one of the Eclipse Caste instead.<br /> <br /> He didn't come away unharmed - the Raksha had slain many of his family, and in fact had just plucked out his right eye (in front of his surviving, bound siblings) when the Exaltation reached him. In the confusion, he stole away with one of the Raksha's Artifacts - the Unblinking Inward Mirror. This is a crystal ball of sorts that could be worn as gaudy jewelry - or as a false eye. Kalifiir uses it as his Sorcerous Initiation artifact.<br /> <br /> Since that time, he has become a skillful negotiator and passable sorcerer. When negotiations fail, he dons a change of outfit and a mask, transforms himself with Wood Dragon's Claws and Invulnerable Skin of Bronze, and stalks the unholy and the criminal as the Stubborn Tiger. <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T11:51:45-07:00","id":1248157,"title":"","content":"The Marked Wolf tells stories about campfires lit deep in the Threshold keeping lesser Wyld things at bay to pups found and retrieved, to veterans who mouth the words with her, to ghosts who failed to learn their lessons, their numbers uncounted. A survivor of the Balorian Crusade, she uses her No Moon talents to recruit Lunars to fill the ranks of the Swords of Luna. Ranks whose numbers are always in need of replenishing from their constant warring with Raksha, Unshaped, and beings stranger yet in the unsung war at the edge of the world. A sorcerer and necromancer of the lowest order, she tattoos young Lunars through skill instead of deep mystical understanding. All of the Silver Pact know a pup raised by The Marked Wolf, and her version of the Oral History is held in high esteem among retellings. <br /> <br /> Storytellers make characters, too...<br /> <br /> I wrote up a few more in a fan project called the <a href=\"https://archiveofourown.org/works/13759032/chapters/31620552\" target=\"_blank\">Lunar Castebooks</a>. If you enjoy reading characters and their backstories, the 1e Castebooks and Aspect books are probably your jam.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T12:18:38-07:00","id":1248166,"title":"","content":"I have to respect a Dawn who rides a badger. That's true class.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T12:50:42-07:00","id":1248181,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FMA245</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1246518-describe-your-character-in-a-few-sentences#post1246518\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Describe your character in a few sentences</div> </div> </div> </div><b>The Knight Raiton</b> is an Eclipse Caste Solar from Nexus. After a personal tragedy early in his life, the Knight Raiton has devoted himself to improving Nexus, both via civil works projects that raise up the poor (accomplished by his rich socialite persona), <i>and </i>via donning a terrifying black archaeopteryx mask and beating up ne'er-do-wells.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T13:43:29-07:00","id":1248198,"title":"","content":"Captain Ahab, expect he's a Water Aspect. And is missing an arm instead of a leg. And instead of a peg or stump, he has a badass jade prosthetic. And he hunts humongous sea monsters, not for revenge, but for fun and profit. And because he is the inheritor of an ancient legacy of similarly one-armed Dragon-bloods that fight to make the seas safe from the beasts of the deep. Nobility and purity of intentions may vary.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13696-knurlurzhad","name":"Knurlurzhad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13696_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T14:57:49-07:00","id":1248221,"title":"","content":"Erichthonius, Owl-totem No Moon wise man. He's your archetypal dad figure, always kind and nurturing, always with words of advice gained from his frequent spiritual quests. He likes to play manipulator every once in a while, inserting tidbits of information via infiltration or via his dream-control abilities to push important people in the direction he believes will best serve his charges.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3657-sagara","name":"Sagara","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3657_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T21:10:03-07:00","id":1248304,"title":"","content":"Seeker of Perfect Harmonies - Twilight Lore Supernal who exalted by using Linguistics, Craft, &amp; Performance to create his first symphony in Old realm that he learned from demons he'd learned to summon. He's awfully happy-go-lucky, with an unexplained obsession with the color blue and far to excellent at making and performing music. Now he has followers and a small cult of people he saved from a cruise-gone-wrong following him around, and he's never been more happy.<br /> <br /> Bonus Question:<br /> <br /> Got tired of Immaculate parents so he: left home, learned broken old realm, learned to summon demons, abandoned a vacation get-a-way, and accidentally started a cult that he still doesn't know revolves around him; and he's never been happier.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12184-lazzerusthanatos","name":"LazzerusThanatos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12184_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-21T00:34:09-07:00","id":1248344,"title":"","content":"Needles: Small aged Djala who's a little creepy, but the purity of his desire to help *everyone everywhere* outweighs the needles in his fingers by a lot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23941-aquatica","name":"Aquatica","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23941_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-21T12:59:55-07:00","id":1248489,"title":"","content":"Orchid Spearshatter, bonus question first: A runaway monk who absconded with sutras of heretical kung-fu, she now pursues allies to help her build a new temple to Kiragaru, God of Killing at a Distance. Has transcribed more scrolls than she has had honest heart-to-heart conversations, by an order of magnitude, and it shows. On the side, she's collecting sparring partners and eventually hopes to found a martial society in their little corner of the Hundred Kingdoms. Generally has the best of intentions, but straightforward to a fault. Supernal Thrown Dawn, but often referred to as a fake-Night-Caste by people on her shit list.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2223,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2223-ketrus","user":"Ketrus","date":". 08-22-2018, 12:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2223-ketrus","name":"Ketrus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"398"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-22T00:32:38-07:00","id":1248650,"title":"","content":"Odoni the Thriceborn : A travelling physician and a middling sorcerer, he lives off the offerings of those he helps along the way. Barefoot and bushy-haired, he is never seen without his satchel, full of herbs, healing salves and strange-looking tools. His quiet and peaceful demeanor, along with his tendency to save people from otherwise fatal illnesses, has attracted a fledging cult to his sides, and he leads them mostly by example. <br /> <br /> Those who find themselves opposing the young Zenith sometimes (often?) find their loved ones and followers afflicted with strange curses or terrible infections, but he is willing to treat even his ennemies without exhorting anything from them. <br /> <br /> The old priest-queen of Oar-zan tried to put him to death for disturbing the peace, but found out too late that the captain of her guards owed his daugther's life to the Thriceborn, and that her subjects remembered him fondly for lifting a curse that afflicted their crops. There is a new priest-queen in Oar-zan.<br /> <br /> The last exalt I had the occasion to play. He was a blast, and somehow terrifying without once ever having to drop his caregiving attitude or raising his voice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-22T05:13:52-07:00","id":1248684,"title":"","content":"Nileen <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://66.media.tumblr.com/a6c0e1335e5bcb086d43927c55c8fe6c/tumblr_og6w7jdUYR1qjd57yo4_1280.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div> Former bodyguard and body double to a princess who assumed her identity when she was killed, then an assassin to avenge her murder. Now she's trying to learn how to be human again.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>success is the ability to go from one failure to the next without any loss of enthusiasm","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1115-the-hug-ninja","name":"The Hug Ninja","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1115_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"324"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-23T18:40:01-07:00","id":1248871,"title":"","content":"I love that picture.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/370-oriares","name":"Oriares","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar370_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-26T16:30:19-07:00","id":1249028,"title":"","content":"Wanasaan Sora, the Black Rain Huntress: a Water Aspect monster hunter, occult investigator, barely functioning alcoholic and Maker of Bad Decisions. Generally unkempt and often smelly. Spends an inordinate amount of time beating herself up over past decisions when she remembers them; tries to remain drunk enough that she doesn't. (This rarely works; when she's not sorry for herself about things she has done, she's sorry for herself about being so controlled by her regrets that she allowed so much of herself to slip into oblivion.) Occasionally manages to rise above her pettiness and do the right thing, much to her surprise.<br /> <br /> Her backstory involves a nasty family split, kinslaying, and causing a regional crisis by zombie apocalypse over <i>really stupid reasons</i>, but it's not like she remembers most of it. This may have something to do with her three decades of heavy drinking <i>or </i>the strange, pale scars criss-crossing her body. Possibly both.<br /> <br /> She also possesses the best worst Intimacy I ever came up with (<i>&quot;Unless people are literally dying or some supernatural shit is afoot, my self-pity is probably more important than whatever business you have&quot;</i>, Principle, Major).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=943303#post943303\" target=\"_blank\">Evocations for the demonic tattoos gained from the Pact with Mara sorcerous initiation</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=907071#post907071\" target=\"_blank\">Pyre-Kindler (Soulsteel and Red Jade Grimscythe, Artifact 3)</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1072019-soulsteel-stormcaller-concept-gravedigger?p=1074897#post1074897\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Descent (Stormcaller's Black Jade Reaver Daiklave cousin, Artifact 5)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1074256-combat-with-corebook-shikari-antagonists?p=1074303#post1074303\" target=\"_blank\">Advice for running the corebook shikari antagonists</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3443-aluminiumtrioxid","name":"aluminiumtrioxid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3443_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-28T15:23:43-07:00","id":1249547,"title":"","content":"Salzan of Salambrimga, the Artificer, Devil-Forgemaster, and Maker of the Black Anvil. He was already one of Creation's top weaponsmiths <i>before</i> he Exalted. He gained patronage under a Death Lord (unknowingly) and learned some Occult knowledge, making his first artifact. Then he was apprenticed to Alveua and made his own version of her Forge of Night, his sorcery focus and craft assisting artifact called the Black Anvil. Now a Sorcerer and a Master Craftsman he sets off to master both and perfect his &quot;inner universe&quot; one flawless masterpiece at a time. His specialty is forging demons and elementals into artifacts.<br /> <br /> Aristocratic by inclination and prone to the black moods of an artist, he frequently blows a king's ransom on gambling and wanton luxury until inspiration strikes him. His Neomah servants handle all of his non-crafting affairs and he prefers to travel by palanquin or in a stagecoach, even though he is perfectly capable of riding an Agata at any time. He finds blood apes to be too brutish to keep around unless he expects trouble or is traveling. He considers (first circle) demons to be Things and not Beings and spend their lives with cavalier disdain, save for a few of his Neomah which he has a slight preference for. He frequently uses Corrupted Brass and has an intense reaction to people who disapprove of using &quot;Malfean Resources&quot; as he calls them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-30T12:50:13-07:00","id":1250035,"title":"","content":"Broken Faith Demagogue - Once an overindulged, pampered Dynast, when he failed to Exalt, he was made an offer by darker powers. Now he revels in his newfound abilities, acting selfishly and cruelly for the sake of selfishness and cruelty. In his first adventure, he tricked a Varangian merchant into helping him financially, stole that man's daughter, forced her to marry him, impregnated her with a probable half-demon child, and abandoned her on the Blessed Isle to the tender mercies of the Wyld Hunt. He wields Onyx Whisper, a vitriol-tainted Plasma Tongue Repeater, and he frequently horrifies the demon living in his head with his personal atrocities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>DrLoveMonkey - &quot;On the other hand having a warhammer that's basically a steel beer keg on the end of a seven foot pole is fucking awesome.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9453-octopoid","name":"Octopoid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9453_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"424"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-30T14:24:29-07:00","id":1250065,"title":"","content":"The Feather in the Storm <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://orig02.deviantart.net/5720/f/2013/218/b/f/katefinish_by_andarix-d6gxyhd.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div> A freelance Deathknight whose worked contracts all over the Scavenger Lands. Not necessarily even for the highest bidder but sometimes just as a pretense to enjoy a connection to the living.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>success is the ability to go from one failure to the next without any loss of enthusiasm","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1115-the-hug-ninja","name":"The Hug Ninja","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1115_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"324"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-30T18:47:28-07:00","id":1250120,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Hug Ninja</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1246518-describe-your-character-in-a-few-sentences?p=1250065#post1250065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Feather in the Storm <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://orig02.deviantart.net/5720/f/2013/218/b/f/katefinish_by_andarix-d6gxyhd.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div> A freelance Deathknight whose worked contracts all over the Scavenger Lands. Not necessarily even for the highest bidder but sometimes just as a pretense to enjoy a connection to the living.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is there a reason her armor says &quot;blood horse house&quot;?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-31T01:12:25-07:00","id":1250197,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1246518-describe-your-character-in-a-few-sentences?p=1250120#post1250120\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there a reason her armor says &quot;blood horse house&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, her homeland of Baran has a caste system where one's blood (ancestry, overall health and literal blood) determines your role. The horse caste are the military and she's kind of failed to live up to her family's expectations which is part of why her life has been this struggle to find her own way.<br /> <br /> The OOC story is that the artist thought the armour was looking a little plain so I went with an actual words as a linguistic bonus that I can use to explain more about the character rather than random symbols that could have embarassing meanings and conotations I wasn't prepared for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>success is the ability to go from one failure to the next without any loss of enthusiasm","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1115-the-hug-ninja","name":"The Hug Ninja","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1115_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"324"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-02T15:10:05-07:00","id":1250863,"title":"","content":"Maheka Marama: Solar Twilight born to a Lookshy Gen, discarded and pushing way too far and too fast to buy her families love with wonders while plagued by throwback to a diehard cauldronist. Believes Immaculate propaganda and views herself as a monster trying to do good before she must be put down.<br /> <br /> The Mortician of the lost graves at the root of the world: A kindly old man and master necromancer Abyssal Daybreak with a cadre of powerful ghosts he empowers as he grows his necromantic might inside his dark necropolis underground. Wants nothing but to be left in peace.<br /> Bonus question: Disgraced Sijan Mortician for marrying a ghost he was to keep the tomb of and settled with her in a small city state to tend their cemetery with his ghost friends.<br /> <br /> Captain Yuri Kochiyama: A Gunzosha from the first age awoken in the age of sorrows and recently granted a solar dawn exaltation, attempting to make the world a safe place for humanity to live in peace. Knows he does not fit in this time and seeks a good place to die. Rides a Simhata born of the god of Simhata's<br /> <br /> Sleet of Bloody Fingers: Dusk Abyssal attempting to free herself from her deathlord master by being servant to any, making a name for themselves as something akin to a god of death by killing anyone for anyones request, works for everyone and attempts to be viewed as a mindless weapon so they may find their path to freedom.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1166-korekore","name":"korekore","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1166_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"141"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T11:27:39-07:00","id":1251125,"title":"","content":"Alanna Tornen: Swift-bladed, silver-tongued bodyguard seeks charges with more power than scruples to whisper a moral compass into. Currently working on (and trying to work it with) the circle's Twilight.<br /> <br /> She was a bored periphery aristocrat who got more than she bargained for - and exactly what she wanted - leaving home as part of a Realm DB's entourage. <br /> <br /> Sesus Midora: As a scion of House Sesus and the granddaughter of spymistress Sesus Nimorah, I will be the best (lesbian strip- er, dancer) ninja that Creation has ever seen, or even better, not seen until way too late. My elite backup dancers can beat up your army but they'd be better at killing them in their sleep. Assuming I don't poison them at all with this poisoned skycutter my awesome Cynis BFF's family gave me. Also I helped kill an Anathema already, though my BFF's escort got the killing blow. <br /> <br /> She's always been super-invested in proving herself by living up to the sneaky, clever image of House Sesus, and then her BFF Cynis Neevah taught her how to party. Ambitious hijinks have ensued.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-04T06:21:37-07:00","id":1251370,"title":"","content":"Delphian Odalisque <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"http://orig13.deviantart.net/2739/f/2013/160/e/8/delphian_by_andarix-d68cyod.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div> A former royal concubine whose desire to improve her homeland saw her be manipulated into poisoning her prince lover, chosen as a Defiler due to her ernest desire to facilitate competent leadership and see everything running just so. However she has gradually learnt to accept her own flaws and accept that she is the leader of her Coven.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>success is the ability to go from one failure to the next without any loss of enthusiasm","edited":{"userid":1115,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1115-the-hug-ninja","user":"The Hug Ninja","date":". 09-04-2018, 01:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1115-the-hug-ninja","name":"The Hug Ninja","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1115_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"324"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-04T08:55:48-07:00","id":1251396,"title":"","content":"Queen Enhenduanna of H'Hui'Shan, Queen of Dragons, Princess of Fallen Sippar, Ruler of Al-Nushan, Chosen of the Gods of Lakes and Rivers, Chosen of the Gods of the Mountains, Chosen of the Gods of the Savannah.... This goes on for a while.<br /> <br /> 6'2' obsidian black skin with a tinge of bronze to it, she has elf like features and her veins glow with white hot heat and her hair does the same, her chest glows slightly with a deep fiery red, at will wings formed of fire appear at her back and she flies with terrifying fury. A sorceress of the highest power she has formed a mountain kingdom with dragons, griffins, golems, fire mages and changed the people to be smarter, stronger and longer lived than humans. The kingdom produces vast amounts of food and that is collected by thousands of earth and wood elementals, its people travel quickly along a vast canal network and the H'Hui'Shan itself is a marvel of towers and glimmering glass universities and libraries.<br /> <br /> In combat she fights with either her ancestral daiklave of orricalcum and red jade, powering blows through enemies defences and blocking all attacks, or vast sorceress energies that melt everything in her path. In diplomacy she is wise, willing to negotiate terms for the betterment of all, but will not stand to be insulted of belittled.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2325,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2325-builder","user":"Builder","date":". 09-04-2018, 11:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2325-builder","name":"Builder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}